(iv) diagrams and sketches of the production processes;
(v) properties; and,
(vi) uses.
(b) Non-ferrous materials and their alloys:
(i) aluminium;
(ii) copper;
(iii) lead;
(iv) zinc; and,
(v) brass:
- sources;
