GENERAL OBJECTIVES
On completion of this Section, students should:
1. develop proficiency in the production of basic architectural drawings using manual and CAD
standards; and,
2. develop proficiency in the reading, preparation and interpretation of architectural plans.
SPECIFIC OBJECTIVES
Students should be able to:
1. prepare detailed drawings;
2. prepare sectional views;
3. apply the principles of geometric construction; and,
4. read and interpret site plans.
