(i) details of windows in masonry block wall (frame, glass fixing, sill, awning,
sliding, sash, casement, pivot);
(ii) details of doors;
(iii) timber staircase;
(iv) roof member;
(v) floors (timber and concrete upgrade);
(vi) columns (timber and concrete);
(vii) beams; and,
(viii) carcase (framed, box and panel).
SECTION 3: BASIC ARCHITECTURAL DRAWINGS (cont’d)
